title: We have gone over our devaluation limit.
new-page: true
tags: event
priority: 1
view-if: currency_value > currency_value_cap
on-arrival: currency_value = currency_value_cap; hans_opinion -=1

= Correction

With the value of our currency having gone down from the agreed limit, hans Luther has taken swift actions to correct this mistake. 

His opinion of us has dropped, due to us not upholding our agreed limit.

